1
00:00:00,471 --> 00:00:01,811
(Sheldon:)I don't understand
what we're doing.

2
00:00:01,973 --> 00:00:03,243
(James:)Shh.

3
00:00:04,075 --> 00:00:05,285
Whose house is that?

4
00:00:05,443 --> 00:00:06,983
(Sheldon:)Carrie Fisher.

5
00:00:07,712 --> 00:00:10,552
(James:)And she's a little crazy,
so get ready to run.

6
00:00:24,729 --> 00:00:27,639
It's not funny anymore, James!

7
00:00:29,634 --> 00:00:32,244
Then why am I laughing!

8
00:00:40,345 --> 00:00:43,845
(James:)Sheldon, this is the perfect end
to a perfect night.

9
00:00:45,917 --> 00:00:47,457
(Sheldon:)Okay.

10
00:00:48,753 --> 00:00:51,033
(Sheldon:)But I think it could have ended
with the karaoke.

11
00:00:52,523 --> 00:00:56,023
(James:)What were you trying to ask me
at the strip club?

